        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ప్రమాణం",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ప్రమాణం — pramāṇaṁ — \"a standard; a norm\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆ కళాశాలలో విద్యా ప్రమాణాలు ఎక్కువ. ā kaḷāśālalō vidyā pramāṇālu ekkuva. Academic standards are high at that college."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ప్రమాణాలు, pramāṇālu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also an oath: ప్రమాణం (pramāṇaṁ) చేయు, to swear."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ప్రమాణం (pramāṇaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit pramāṇa, \"measure; a standard, an authority; proof\" (CDIAL 8723)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
