          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ధోరణి (dhōraṇi) may go back to Sanskrit dhoraṇī, \"an uninterrupted series\" (Monier-Williams), but the link is not settled."
            }
          ]
